  "dg.first.aria": "The steps on two platforms before the x86 core wakes: on Intel, CSME and Boot Guard verify the start of the firmware; on AMD, the PSP verifies the boot loader, trains memory and unpacks the firmware into memory",
  "dg.first.cap": "What happens before the x86 core fetches its first instruction. The AMD column comes from coreboot's AMD 17h documentation. The Intel column's Boot Guard details come from a UEFI Forum white paper and third-party analysis, as Intel has not published the specification.",
